license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Reproducible pipeline evaluating a monotonic calibrated lattice ensemble
  against logistic regression, random forest, XGBoost, monotone-constrained
  XGBoost, an Explainable Boosting Machine and a monotone GAM on three
  credit-scoring benchmarks, under a parity-controlled tuning budget with
  Holm-Bonferroni and Nadeau-Bengio corrected inference, full-population
  counterfactual recourse with Wilson confidence intervals, and head-to-head
  explanation-stability benchmarking against KernelSHAP and LIME.
